@api = https://api.blackportal.cloud
@observationId = 1280935

### First request: five render records (reuse fresh results and load details on demand)
GET {{api}}/api/renders?limit=5
Accept: application/json

### Discover the public API
GET {{api}}/api
Accept: application/json

### Live OpenAPI contract
GET {{api}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### All locations (cache this rich response)
GET {{api}}/api/locations
Accept: application/json

### Compact location directory (load full details only when opened)
GET {{api}}/api/locations/directory
Accept: application/json

### Compact location map metadata
GET {{api}}/api/locations/map
Accept: application/json

### One location
GET {{api}}/api/locations/5
Accept: application/json

### Archive warps for that location
GET {{api}}/api/warps?locationId=5&limit=100
Accept: application/json

### Metadata for an eligible bounded historical Java save
GET {{api}}/api/warps/8/world-download
Accept: application/json

### Resumable immutable bounded-world ZIP
GET {{api}}/api/warps/8/world-download.zip
Range: bytes=0-1048575

### WDL-derived renders for that location
GET {{api}}/api/renders?locationId=5&limit=100
Accept: application/json

### One render (blueMapUrl is the standalone viewer; see docs/BLUEMAP-3D.md for location links)
GET {{api}}/api/renders/38
Accept: application/json

### All public Nether renders, first page
GET {{api}}/api/renders?dimension=1&limit=500&offset=0
Accept: application/json

### Historical images for one location
GET {{api}}/api/attachments?locationId=1030&mediaType=Image&limit=100
Accept: application/json

### Group directory
GET {{api}}/api/groups
Accept: application/json

### One group with its builds and highways
GET {{api}}/api/groups/7
Accept: application/json

### Public reviewed highways and canals
GET {{api}}/api/highways
Accept: application/json

### Combined primary/base render catalog
GET {{api}}/api/maprenders/catalog
Accept: application/json

### Available Find sources and coverage
GET {{api}}/api/find/sources
Accept: application/json

### Saved signs with a whole-word match
GET {{api}}/api/find?dimension=overworld&kinds=sign&text=Mu&match=word&hideBlankSigns=true&limit=5
Accept: application/json

### Captured mob IDs in public illegal-spawner records for one dimension
GET {{api}}/api/find/spawner-mobs?dimension=overworld
Accept: application/json

### Captured ghast spawners, first five positions
GET {{api}}/api/find?dimension=overworld&kinds=spawner&spawnerMob=minecraft:ghast&limit=5
Accept: application/json

### Exact positions in a small viewport; limit/offset do not page marker responses
GET {{api}}/api/find/markers?dimension=overworld&kinds=sign&minX=61176&minZ=197427&maxX=61176&maxZ=197427
Accept: application/json

### Evidence on selection: replace this ID with points[0][0] from the current marker response
GET {{api}}/api/find/observations/{{observationId}}
Accept: application/json

### Saved containers holding totems
GET {{api}}/api/find?dimension=overworld&kinds=storage&text=totem_of_undying&contentsRecorded=true&hideEmpty=true&limit=5
Accept: application/json

### Named mobs in a saved capture
GET {{api}}/api/find?dimension=overworld&kinds=mob&renderIds=19&namedOnly=true&limit=5
Accept: application/json

### Saved sign history at a position
GET {{api}}/api/find/history?dimension=overworld&kind=sign&x=-126043&y=80&z=-77614
Accept: application/json

### Recorded Nether highway activity
GET {{api}}/api/nocom/highways?dimension=nether&direction=northeast
Accept: application/json

### Released End observation periods
GET {{api}}/api/nocom/periods?dimension=end
Accept: application/json
